**Bug:** `extractTags(from:)` split on spaces and kept only `hasPrefix("#")` tokens, so any `#` preceded/enclosed by punctuation never became a leading-`#` token and was dropped.

**Fix** (`swift/Sources/NoteKit/NoteKit.swift`): replaced the whitespace-split with a character scan that anchors on each `#` and reads the following run of valid tag chars (letters, numbers, `_`, `-`). Preserves order; no previously-working extraction regressed.

